            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>日盛台駿(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:6958:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/6958\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">6958-TW</a>)20日13:30下跌1.6元，股價跌停報14.7元，委買20張、委賣2張，成交267張。</p></section><p></p><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>主要業務為融資租賃業務。分期付款買賣業務。營業租賃業務。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>日盛台駿(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:6958:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/6958\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">6958-TW</a>)近5日股價下跌0.31%，集中市場<a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/TWS/TSE01\">加權指數</a>下跌10.83%，股價漲幅表現優於大盤。</p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>近5日籌碼</em></p></section><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul> <li>三大法人合計買賣超：+179 張</li> <li>外資買賣超：+164 張</li> <li>投信買賣超：0 張</li> <li>自營商買賣超：+15 張</li> <li>融資增減：-2 張</li> <li>融券增減：0 張</li> </ul></section></main>",
